# Tavči Kuhna × Ayatana — environment variables (template)
#
# This is a STATIC website — no API keys are needed at runtime.
# This file exists per the B.L.A.S.T. protocol convention.
#
# Future Phase 2 / Phase 3 work may require:
#   - A Google Maps Embed API key (if swapping the iframe for the embed API)
#   - A Mailchimp / ConvertKit token (if a newsletter form is reintroduced)
#   - A reservation system token (if "Book a table" becomes a real form)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values when those features are added.

GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_API_KEY=
NEWSLETTER_PROVIDER_TOKEN=
RESERVATION_PROVIDER_TOKEN=
